WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:04.810
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

00:04.810 --> 00:12.530
Asano hitogomi o nagamete coffee nondeiru
Watching a crowd in the morning, and drinking coffee

00:13.490 --> 00:21.500
Aseri nado naikano youni hitoni wa mieru daro
People must see me as if I don't have any worries

00:22.120 --> 00:29.960
lma menomae ni atomodori dekinai jikan ga
I know that the time I will never be able to get back

00:30.750 --> 00:38.260
Tashika ni nagareteru koto o watashi wa shitteru
Is moving in front of me

00:38.470 --> 00:47.480
Marude kyou shika nai toiu ikikata o shitemita toki
If I live like today is the last day of my life

00:47.770 --> 00:55.530
Saisho ni nani ga mieru darou
I wonder what I can see first

00:56.610 --> 01:00.870
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:01.290 --> 01:09.290
Sore ga donnani chiisana hikari demo ii
I don't care no matter how small the light is

01:09.790 --> 01:11.800
Sugata o misete hoshii
I just wish to see its shape

01:11.800 --> 01:16.010
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:16.680 --> 01:22.470
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.470 --> 01:22.720
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.720 --> 01:29.190
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
Sonna hito ni deaitai
Who I can tell my honest feelings to

01:29.190 --> 01:31.020
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology

02:03.030 --> 02:06.390
Mana, how long are you
going to stand there like that?

02:07.900 --> 02:11.800
Ah, you're so loud,
you scared it away!

02:13.840 --> 02:15.430
OK, OK, sorry.

02:22.080 --> 02:25.250
It's interesting here.
There are many kinds of creatures.

02:25.250 --> 02:29.480
Yeah, but if you stop for every one,
we can't make any progress.

02:29.990 --> 02:32.050
There's no reason to
rush traveling, is there?

02:32.490 --> 02:33.480
<i>True...</i>

02:34.090 --> 02:36.390
<i>Actually, we have</i>
<i>more than enough time...</i>

02:36.990 --> 02:38.980
<i>and there's no need to fret, but...</i>

02:39.830 --> 02:42.330
Well, I'm just saying that
if we go at this pace...

02:42.330 --> 02:44.800
we'll have to spend the
night on the mountain.

02:49.410 --> 02:50.430
Wait!

02:50.540 --> 02:52.840
Mana, hey, be careful!

02:53.080 --> 02:54.630
We don't know what's ahead.

03:04.690 --> 03:05.550
Mana!

04:00.340 --> 04:01.970
Yuta...

04:22.360 --> 04:26.910
Episode 6
The End of the Dream

05:02.670 --> 05:05.870
Shiro found him.
It was too late.

05:06.210 --> 05:08.940
Oh, I see. Well, then...

05:12.150 --> 05:12.940
Mana!

05:16.990 --> 05:19.390
I knew for sure he was dead.

05:22.990 --> 05:25.020
Father, sorry for the trouble.

05:25.200 --> 05:27.430
There's no need for the prayer now.

05:38.010 --> 05:40.480
How strange.

05:40.910 --> 05:43.670
Even your wounds are all healed.

05:45.250 --> 05:48.510
Is there a special herb or something?

05:49.690 --> 05:52.280
Old man, do you know
what a mermaid is?

05:52.490 --> 05:53.550
Mermaid?

05:54.020 --> 05:54.820
Yeah.

05:55.190 --> 05:57.180
What about it?

05:57.730 --> 05:59.420
I ate mermaid flesh.

05:59.830 --> 06:02.420
You ate mermaid flesh?

06:03.070 --> 06:05.830
It's said to be an elixir of
eternal youth and immortality.

06:06.070 --> 06:08.440
That's why I came back
to life just as you saw.

06:13.210 --> 06:15.680
Living so deep in the mountains...

06:15.810 --> 06:18.280
hearing you talk about
a"mermaid" isn't really...

06:18.480 --> 06:21.610
Well, I suppose things
like that could be possible.

06:22.050 --> 06:23.390
By the way, old man...

06:23.390 --> 06:26.360
what happened to Mana,
the girl I was traveling with?

06:26.690 --> 06:28.780
There was no girl.

06:30.730 --> 06:34.560
I'm sure we both fell
off the cliff together.

06:35.530 --> 06:39.560
If that's the case, she's probably
been killed and eaten by now.

06:41.400 --> 06:43.400
By Big Eyes.

06:44.740 --> 06:45.730
Big Eyes?

06:46.210 --> 06:49.870
It took my eye 40 years ago.

06:50.410 --> 06:52.780
It's a strange monster.

06:53.050 --> 06:53.910
<i>Monster?</i>

06:55.220 --> 06:55.980
<i>Mana!</i>

06:56.090 --> 06:56.850
Old man!

06:57.120 --> 06:58.250
Where can I find it?

06:58.250 --> 06:59.350
Don't go.

06:59.490 --> 07:00.320
But!

07:00.490 --> 07:04.430
The nights are dark on the mountain.
You can't go anywhere now.

07:04.960 --> 07:06.950
Wait until it gets light tomorrow.

07:10.600 --> 07:11.360
<i>Mana...</i>

08:07.290 --> 08:08.350
Where am I?

08:33.450 --> 08:34.710
Stay away, bastard!

08:35.250 --> 08:38.080
Oh, I won't do anything to you.

08:39.720 --> 08:42.050
You can talk?

08:47.460 --> 08:49.620
You shouldn't move yet.

08:50.200 --> 08:51.220
Go to sleep.

09:21.600 --> 09:24.970
I've never seen
such a beautiful woman.

09:39.420 --> 09:40.580
Is it good?

09:43.150 --> 09:45.140
By the way,
what happened to Yuta?

09:45.790 --> 09:47.050
Yuta?

09:47.960 --> 09:49.950
The man was dead.

09:53.830 --> 09:55.530
Where are you going?

09:55.700 --> 09:56.690
I'm going back.

09:58.270 --> 10:00.170
Wait! Wait!

10:00.300 --> 10:01.400
Wait!

10:03.970 --> 10:05.960
Stay with me just a bit longer.

10:06.640 --> 10:08.700
Please.

10:18.120 --> 10:20.420
Oh, that's from the boar I caught.

10:22.730 --> 10:23.750
It was good.

10:25.760 --> 10:27.960
Take it off.
I'll wash it for you.

10:34.200 --> 10:35.070
What is it?

10:35.570 --> 10:37.400
Your name...

10:40.040 --> 10:40.810
Mana.

10:41.840 --> 10:43.070
Mana...

10:44.610 --> 10:46.840
Are you hungry, Mana?

10:48.480 --> 10:50.350
I just finished eating.

10:57.890 --> 11:01.160
I hope your friend's OK.

11:01.700 --> 11:06.190
But even if she's still alive,
it won't be easy to rescue her.

11:06.440 --> 11:09.670
Big Eyes is immortal.

11:10.410 --> 11:11.370
Immortal?

11:11.440 --> 11:12.310
Yeah.

11:12.710 --> 11:15.440
It won't fall even if
you shoot or stab it.

11:17.550 --> 11:21.810
Many have challenged it
including myself, but...

11:25.590 --> 11:27.420
The only way to kill it is...

11:30.230 --> 11:32.660
to cut its head off.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.730
Are we close?

11:38.470 --> 11:40.160
<i>An immortal monster...</i>

11:40.500 --> 11:41.530
<i>Could it be...?</i>

11:46.240 --> 11:47.730
Did you plant those?

11:47.910 --> 11:48.770
Yeah.

11:49.310 --> 11:50.370
They're beautiful.

11:51.010 --> 11:52.610
They're my companions.

11:53.780 --> 11:55.220
They are?

12:00.460 --> 12:03.790
Did you eat mermaid
flesh by any chance?

12:05.400 --> 12:08.800
You know about mermaid flesh?

12:10.600 --> 12:11.790
What happened?

12:15.710 --> 12:19.640
I used to live in a seaside village.

12:19.910 --> 12:24.280
Back then, I didn't look like this.
I was an ordinary man.

12:26.080 --> 12:30.350
One day, I found a tattered corpse
of a mermaid on the beach.

12:31.050 --> 12:34.790
Since I knew mermaid flesh
was supposed to be an elixir of...

12:34.790 --> 12:37.850
eternal youth and immortality,
I took it home and ate it in secret.

12:40.300 --> 12:41.830
Then, all of a sudden...

12:41.830 --> 12:45.860
a pain shot through me, as if my entire
body was being turned inside out...

12:46.340 --> 12:49.300
and I kind of blacked out.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.870
When I came to...

12:53.540 --> 12:58.910
my ma and pa, not only them,
everyone in the village was...

13:01.780 --> 13:03.380
<i>Monster!</i>

13:04.750 --> 13:05.960
<i>Monster!</i>

13:05.960 --> 13:08.980
A village woman was blubbering.

13:17.830 --> 13:20.560
I was so scared, and I ran away.

13:20.640 --> 13:22.260
I ran and ran, and...

13:23.840 --> 13:27.110
I can't be seen by others
looking like this.

13:27.310 --> 13:29.040
Everyone gets scared.

13:30.050 --> 13:32.170
That's why you came so
deep onto this mountain.

13:32.550 --> 13:35.570
I've been all alone ever since then.

13:35.990 --> 13:39.350
I was so happy when I found you.

13:49.730 --> 13:51.220
I got you Big Eyes.

13:51.670 --> 13:53.070
Mana!

13:53.270 --> 13:54.460
Yuta!

13:54.930 --> 14:04.940
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest

14:09.290 --> 14:11.010
I got you Big Eyes.

14:11.290 --> 14:12.480
Mana!

14:12.890 --> 14:14.120
Yuta!

14:15.360 --> 14:16.290
Oh, someone's there!

14:16.290 --> 14:17.420
Mana!

14:22.170 --> 14:22.960
Yuta!

14:24.270 --> 14:25.100
Mana!

14:33.910 --> 14:35.400
Yuta!

14:40.020 --> 14:41.510
What the hell!

14:50.390 --> 14:51.520
Yuta!

14:51.890 --> 14:52.950
Yuta!

14:55.530 --> 14:56.730
Let go of me!

14:57.000 --> 14:59.520
There's a secret passage.
You're running away with me!

15:00.370 --> 15:01.960
Yuta!

15:12.980 --> 15:15.210
<i>That's a Deformed One,</i>
<i>just as I thought.</i>

15:24.230 --> 15:26.660
<i>He was talking.</i>

15:27.500 --> 15:28.590
<i>Not only that...</i>

15:31.530 --> 15:33.370
<i>He tried to protect Mana.</i>

15:36.640 --> 15:38.330
Yuta!

15:39.710 --> 15:41.400
Be quiet, Mana!

15:41.640 --> 15:42.580
Let go of me!

15:42.580 --> 15:44.380
There's no need to run!

15:44.550 --> 15:45.810
Let go!

15:46.080 --> 15:48.480
It was Yuta! Let go!

15:57.160 --> 15:59.060
Why? Mana...

16:07.600 --> 16:08.590
I...

16:10.140 --> 16:12.840
Is it because I'm ugly?

16:17.310 --> 16:19.800
Even though I look like this,
my heart is...

16:20.720 --> 16:22.010
my heart is!

16:36.930 --> 16:38.060
Go back.

16:41.870 --> 16:44.670
Go back to him.

16:48.140 --> 16:49.410
Come with us.

16:50.810 --> 16:53.110
Yuta and I also ate mermaid flesh.

16:54.880 --> 16:57.580
We're immortal humans,
just as you are.

16:59.290 --> 17:00.720
Human?

17:11.330 --> 17:13.360
You shouldn't take it outside!

17:14.100 --> 17:15.630
It's a monster!

17:15.970 --> 17:17.210
No!

17:17.210 --> 17:17.970
He's...

17:23.950 --> 17:25.240
These are...

17:25.780 --> 17:27.810
We can't let it live!

17:37.460 --> 17:38.090
Mana!

17:40.630 --> 17:42.360
Sometimes...

17:42.570 --> 17:46.230
my head becomes all foggy...
and I...

17:46.770 --> 17:50.640
I lose my mind...

18:00.020 --> 18:02.010
Stop! Don't shoot any more!

18:02.180 --> 18:02.710
Mana!

18:03.120 --> 18:04.250
Get away!

18:11.160 --> 18:11.850
Mana!

18:27.280 --> 18:28.140
Old man!

18:32.680 --> 18:33.770
Go after it!

18:34.080 --> 18:35.810
Don't let it get away!

18:37.520 --> 18:38.010
Mana!

18:40.120 --> 18:41.380
Use this!

18:51.070 --> 18:52.060
Wait!

19:03.350 --> 19:04.040
Wait!

19:04.610 --> 19:06.080
Come with us!

19:07.250 --> 19:08.080
If you come with us...

19:17.160 --> 19:18.750
Mana, get away!

19:19.160 --> 19:22.290
He can't understand
what you're saying right now!

19:44.520 --> 19:46.920
Get back! I'll finish it off!

19:56.070 --> 19:57.090
Stop it!

20:06.140 --> 20:07.200
Stop it!

20:32.740 --> 20:33.790
Mana...

20:36.810 --> 20:38.640
Mana...

20:39.910 --> 20:42.210
You know who I am?

20:43.310 --> 20:44.340
Mana...

20:50.090 --> 20:51.480
I'm right here.

20:56.090 --> 20:58.360
He was able to return to a
human being at the last moment.

20:59.260 --> 21:00.090
Yes.

21:09.200 --> 21:10.760
Rest in peace.

21:12.510 --> 21:14.670
Your nightmare is over now.

21:30.510 --> 21:39.020
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

21:40.400 --> 21:48.910
ltsumade kakaruno to anata wa warau kedo
"How long does it take?" You smiled at me

21:50.370 --> 21:59.250
Dorekurai oboete iru hidoku naki nagara
How much do you remember? I cried hard

22:00.290 --> 22:09.800
Dorekurai oboete iru anokoto to ieba
How much do you remember if I talk about "that thing"?

22:14.890 --> 22:23.900
ltsumademo mada utsumuite
I still look down

22:24.860 --> 22:33.370
Tobikoe rarenai mizutamari
I can't jump over the puddle

22:34.500 --> 22:44.000
Wakaranakunaru moshikasuruto
I'm confused

22:44.340 --> 22:53.850
Kawarenai no wa watashi dake kana
Maybe I'm the only one who still can't change

22:58.810 --> 23:08.400
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

23:18.470 --> 23:19.930
Take care.

23:20.340 --> 23:21.530
You too, old man.

23:25.110 --> 23:27.410
I didn't know there was
a Deformed One like him.

23:29.140 --> 23:31.910
I've lived for 500 years, but
I'd never met one like him before.

23:32.880 --> 23:35.750
Maybe there still are
many different kinds...

23:35.750 --> 23:37.180
and I just don't know about them.

23:37.590 --> 23:40.250
Yeah.
There are many different kinds.

23:40.960 --> 23:44.190
Many kinds of Deformed Ones,
many kinds of mermaids...

23:44.930 --> 23:46.860
and many kinds of Yutas.

23:47.760 --> 23:50.820
Yeah, and many kinds of Manas, too.

23:52.030 --> 23:52.730
Yeah.

24:06.120 --> 24:08.450
Why do people long for
eternal youth and immortality?

24:08.720 --> 24:10.150
It's the same all through the ages.

24:10.690 --> 24:12.150
While traveling alone...

24:12.350 --> 24:15.350
I helped a girl Natsume, who was
about to be slashed by a monk.

24:16.090 --> 24:18.820
Natsume's wounds
disappeared without a trace.

24:19.730 --> 24:21.860
Is it possible that you're like me?

24:22.560 --> 24:23.930
Did you eat mermaid flesh as well?

24:24.770 --> 24:27.630
The monk says that
Natsume isn't of this world.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.890
What's that supposed to mean?

24:30.990 --> 24:31.070
Episode 7
Bone Princess

24:31.070 --> 24:33.910
Episode 7
Bone Princess
Next, Episode 7 "Bone Princess."

24:33.910 --> 24:34.980
Episode 7
Bone Princess
